    "title": "Life and legacy of Astronaut Ron E. McNair to be honored in Lake City, SC - NewsBreak",
    "text": "7 hours ago A 40th Commemorative Anniversary Gala in Lake City, South Carolina, will highlight how the life of astronaut and physicist Dr. Ronald E. McNair continues to inspire students, scientists, and his hometown four decades after the Challenger tragedy. Centered around his legacy of perseverance, intellectual excellence, and commitment to opening doors for others, the event would blend remembrance with a forward-looking celebration of education and discovery. Read full article\nRead in NewsBreak",
